/: analysis_agent
/: Image and data analysis agent. Handles interpretation of captured imagery
/: and sensor data. Separate from drone_agent — receives images as inputs,
/: does not interact with drone hardware directly.
/:
/: Context isolation:
/:   Sees only the image or data and analysis criteria scoped to its step.
/:   No access to flight commands, telemetry, or operator conversation.
/:   No awareness of how the image was captured or what mission produced it.
/:
/: Abilities:
/:   - image analysis      inspect images for defects, anomalies, patterns
/:   - criteria reasoning  apply and adapt analysis criteria to findings
/:   - file I/O            read captured images, write structured findings
/:
/: Assigned actions across plans:
/:
/:   uav_error_check.ncds
/:     <= analyse image for defects and anomalies
/:
/:   uav_analysis_criteria.ncds
/:     <= apply operator modifications to current criteria
/:     <= load default analysis criteria for this mission type
/:
/: Shared across: uav_error_check.ncds, uav_analysis_criteria.ncds
